# 🔹 DATASETS AND LARGE DATA

############################
# Ignore EVERYTHING under data/ (datasets, outputs, libraries, chats, RAG index,
# heavy STLs) EXCEPT the small assets essential to run the project.
# Ignore everything under data/* and re-include ONLY the small essential assets.
# (Comments must be on their own line: .gitignore does not support inline #.)
data/*
# Configuration YAMLs (default.yaml, etc.) — essential:
!data/config/
# ...but not the throwaway preview snapshot:
data/config/conf_simuscan/temp.yaml
# User Python generators — code:
!data/user_generators/

datasets/
raw/
processed/

